{"v":4,"catch":"一款短程RPG，你可以摧毀被稱為“無機”的非攻擊性敵人","desc":"在某個世界裏，“無機物”突然開始隨處可見，給居民帶來了麻煩。\n踏上穿越這個世界的旅程，同時幫助摧毀無機物。\n\n**InorStreet**是一款融合了物理力學的短鏡頭RPG。\n雖然無機物不會攻擊你，但它們會反射你的射擊。 巧妙地躲避或計時你的攻擊，以避開反射並將其擊倒！","publisher":"Edia","release":"2025-01-30","genres":["射擊","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b992598b9f415355a640b056d28d3ddb9f08fd165a7f358b24dc1b6f82c1885.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ce2deeb5f3f3c9166cf47c443930b2f00e47e5598a814b20bf3b94344e234d92.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f32b8b17483a157f18c67f813eba9220293cabf0c269f37ce56d3aa3c8a9452.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/97cada04abe53f086e2b6de32e73c71bcd99af6712c1c74261b3bf685e1f156e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b780202fa000","dlc":[]}